---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import HubSpotForm from '../components/HubSpotForm.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Ultimate Blueprint for Fat Loss"
  description="Get Aquam Fitness's free Ultimate Blueprint for Fat Loss: practical guidance on calorie balance, protein, daily movement, recovery and sustainable habits."
  mood="coaching"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Ultimate Blueprint for Fat Loss', path: '/free-guide/' }]}
>
  <PageHero
    mood="coaching"
    title="Get the Ultimate Blueprint for Fat Loss"
    lead="A straightforward guide to the foundations of sustainable fat loss—without crash diets, complicated rules, or trying to spend your life in the gym."
  >
    <div slot="aside" class="guide-form">
      <h2>Get the free blueprint</h2>
      <HubSpotForm id="free-guide-signup" />
      <p class="small muted">You'll also get occasional training and nutrition tips. Unsubscribe any time.</p>
    </div>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap inside">
      <h2>What you'll learn</h2>
      <p>This guide breaks down the core habits that can help you make fat-loss progress while balancing work, family and the rest of your life.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Calorie balance without extreme dieting:</strong> why a moderate, sustainable calorie deficit matters.</li>
        <li><strong>Protein and balanced nutrition:</strong> how to prioritize protein while still making room for carbohydrates and fats.</li>
        <li><strong>Daily movement and strength training:</strong> how everyday activity complements your workouts.</li>
        <li><strong>Recovery and stress management:</strong> why sleep, recovery and consistency belong in the plan, too.</li>
        <li><strong>Practical habits for the long game:</strong> using filling, nutrient-dense foods and focusing on the choices you can control.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="small muted">This is an educational guide to the fundamentals—not a personalized meal plan, calorie prescription, or substitute for one-on-one coaching.</p>
      <div class="next-step">
        <h2>Want help putting it into practice?</h2>
        <p>The guide explains the foundations. Our one-on-one coaching helps you apply them to your goals, preferences and schedule, with ongoing support and adjustments.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/coaching/">Explore 1:1 coaching</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .guide-form { display: grid; gap: 16px; background: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px); }
  .guide-form h2 { font-size: var(--fs-h3); margin: 0; }
  .guide-form p { margin: 0; }
  .inside { max-width: 760px; }
  .inside ul { color: var(--text); }
  .inside li + li { margin-top: 12px; }
  .inside li::marker { color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .next-step { margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
</style>
